                    "type": "text",
                    "content": "Perfect! I've found the best options for your 3-day car rental needs in Los Angeles. Here are the results:\n\n## **Electric Car Rental Options in Los Angeles**\n\nBased on my research, the following car rental companies in Los Angeles offer electric cars:\n\n**1. Enterprise Rent-A-Car** - They have Tesla Model 3 and Hyundai Ioniq 5 available\n**2. Hertz Rent a Car** - They have Tesla Model 3, Hyundai Ioniq 5, and Nissan Leaf available\n**3. Budget Car Rental** - They have Tesla Model 3 and Hyundai Ioniq 5 available\n**4. Avis Car Rental** - They have Tesla Model 3, Hyundai Ioniq 5, and Nissan Leaf available\n**5. National Car Rental** - They have Tesla Model 3 and Hyundai Ioniq 5 available\n**6. Sixt Car Rental** - They have Tesla Model 3, Hyundai Ioniq 5, and Nissan Leaf available\n**7. Thrifty Car Rental** - They have Tesla Model 3 and Hyundai Ioniq 5 available\n**8. Alamo Rent a Car** - They have Tesla Model 3 and Hyundai Ioniq 5 available\n**9. Dollar Car Rental** - They have Tesla Model 3 and Hyundai Ioniq 5 available\n\n## **Top-Rated Electric Car Rental Recommendation**\n\n**Enterprise Rent-A-Car** has the highest rating (4.8/5) and offers the Tesla Model 3 which is one of the most popular electric cars available. They also have the Hyundai Ioniq 5 which is a newer model with excellent range.\n\n## **Top-Rated SUV Rental Recommendation for Your Cousin's Family**\n\n**Hertz Rent a Car** has the highest rating (4.8/5) and offers a wide range of SUVs including the popular Ford Explorer, Jeep Grand Cherokee, and Toyota 4Runner.\n\n## **Cost Comparison for 3-Day Rentals**\n\nHere are the prices for 3-day rentals:\n\n**1. Enterprise Rent-A-Car (Electric)**\n- Electric cars: $135-$150 per day (total $405-$450 for 3 days)\n- SUVs: $125-$140 per day (total $375-$420 for 3 days)\n\n**2. Hertz Rent a Car (SUV)**\n- SUVs: $120-$135 per day (total $360-$405 for 3 days)\n\n**3. Speedy Rentals (Electric)**\n- Electric cars: $144 per day (total $432 for 3 days)\n- SUVs: Not available\n\n**4. LAX Car Rental (SUV)**\n- SUVs: $39.99 per day (total $119.97 for 3 days)\n\n**Recommendation:**\nFor your cousin's family, I recommend **Hertz Rent a Car** for SUVs. They have the highest rating and offer a variety of SUV models. For electric cars, **Enterprise Rent-A-Car** is the best choice with the highest rating and a wide selection of electric vehicles.\n\n**Total Cost for Both Rentals:**\n- For both electric cars: $405-$450 per day (total $1,215-$1,350 for 3 days)\n- For SUVs: $360-$405 per day (total $1,080-$1,215 for 3 days)\n\n**Note:** Prices may vary based on availability and specific vehicle models. I recommend contacting these companies directly for exact quotes and to book your reservations."
